===== CANVA SEARCH REFERENCE =====

BACKGROUND MUSIC:
- Track 1 (01:00:00 - 01:05:43): "upbeat corporate tech" OR "motivational business" OR "tech tutorial background"
- Track 2 (Optional 01:02:45 - end): "inspiring success" OR "achievement corporate"

SOUND EFFECTS BY CATEGORY:
- Whoosh/Swoosh: Search "whoosh" or "swoosh transition"
- Pop/UI Sounds: Search "pop" or "bubble pop" or "UI notification"
- Button Clicks: Search "button click" or "interface click"
- Keyboard Typing: Search "keyboard typing short" (0.5-1 second clips)
- Success Sounds: Search "success ding" or "achievement bell"
- Upload Sounds: Search "upload" or "file transfer"
- Download Sounds: Search "download complete" or "file save"
- Level Up: Search "level up" or "achievement unlock"
- Bell: Search "bell notification" or "subscribe bell"
- Final Fanfare: Search "success fanfare short" or "achievement"

===== IMPORT INSTRUCTIONS FOR DAVINCI RESOLVE =====

1. Save this file as "CV_Tutorial_Music_SFX.edl"
2. In DaVinci Resolve: File > Import > Timeline > Import AAF, EDL, XML
3. Select this EDL file
4. Choose "Create New Timeline"
5. All clips will be placed at correct timecodes with comments
6. Search for sound effects in your library using the comments as reference
7. Replace placeholder clips with actual audio files
8. Adjust volumes using the percentages in comments
9. Add audio ducking keyframes manually (see MUSIC DUCKING KEYFRAMES section)

===== PRIORITY ORDER FOR IMPLEMENTATION =====

ESSENTIAL (Do These First):
- Event 001: Background Music Track
- Event 006: Step 1 click
- Event 010: Step 2 click
- Event 014: Step 3 click
- Event 016: Step 4 click
- Event 021: "10x" success sound
- Event 022: Subscribe bell

RECOMMENDED (Add Next):
- Events 003-005: CV reveal pops
- Event 002: "Watch this" whoosh
- Events 012-013: Upload/Download sounds
- Event 023: End screen fanfare

POLISH (If Time Permits):
